WEBVTT

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:03.877
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.927 --> 00:00:06.040
<v><b>A:</b></v> She’s American.

00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:12.952
Is she American?

00:00:14.935 --> 00:00:15.614
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.607 --> 00:00:18.130
<v><b>B:</b></v> He plays the piano.

00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:25.330
Does he play the piano?

00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:27.987
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:29.043 --> 00:00:30.304
<v><b>A:</b></v> You like music.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.064
Do you like music?

00:00:39.145 --> 00:00:39.894
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:40.893 --> 00:00:42.480
<v><b>B:</b></v> Anna’s taking a shower.

00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:49.906
Is Anna taking a shower?

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:52.852
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:54.804
<v><b>A:</b></v> You’re tired.

00:01:00.404 --> 00:01:01.425
Are you tired?

00:01:03.443 --> 00:01:04.290
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:05.314 --> 00:01:06.717
<v><b>B:</b></v> She lives near here.

00:01:12.408 --> 00:01:13.837
Does she live near here?

00:01:15.889 --> 00:01:16.770
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:17.797 --> 00:01:18.637
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m late.

00:01:24.198 --> 00:01:25.037
Am I late?

00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:27.600
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:30.866
<v><b>B:</b></v> The train arrives at six o’clock.

00:01:36.475 --> 00:01:38.822
Does the train arrive at six o’clock?